# Kelly visit attach-queue

Before adding or promoting a public stop, read `src/data/kelly-county-visits/pending-attachments.json`.

If the new stop’s `city` or `counties` matches an `open` item, attach it in the same edit:

- Prefer `addStop` in `scripts/apply-kelly-visit-edits.cjs` (it consumes the queue automatically).
- If you edit the ledger by hand, create the companion stop (or notes) and set that queue item to `attached` with `attachedToStopId`.

Do not invent a booked KLEK air time. Use the station booking links. Do not publish campaign email addresses.
